Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person3:
	.string "My MOéMON and I came to watch the\n"
	.string "FRONTIER's battles. They're so\l"
	.string "exciting!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person4:
	.string "Only the very best TRAINERS make it\n"
	.string "far in the FRONTIER.$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person5:
	.string "The FRONTIER BRAINS are the toughest\n"
	.string "TRAINERS in SINNOH. Maybe in the\l"
	.string "world!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person6:
	.string "I want to see a FRONTIER BRAIN\n"
	.string "battle! I'll wait all day if I have to!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person7:
	.string "I'm studying every battle here. I'll be\n"
	.string "ready someday.$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person8:
	.string "I'm going to sneak into the BATTLE\n"
	.string "TOWER! ...Just kidding. Probably.$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person9:
	.string "I came to cheer for my friend! She's\n"
	.string "going to win everything!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person10:
	.string "Out here, everybody's a fighter. I like\n"
	.string "that.$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person11:
	.string "Hyah! The FRONTIER is the ultimate\n"
	.string "training ground!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person15:
	.string "I come here every weekend to watch\n"
	.string "the battles. Best seat in the house!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person16:
	.string "I'm collecting autographs from every\n"
	.string "TRAINER who beats a FRONTIER BRAIN.$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person17:
	.string "The FRONTIER is a grand place. I've\n"
	.string "watched battles here for years.$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person18:
	.string "I'm going to beat every FRONTIER\n"
	.string "BRAIN! As soon as I learn to swim!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person19:
	.string "Five facilities, five different kinds\n"
	.string "of battle. Which one will you try\l"
	.string "first?$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person20:
	.string "I ride in from the ranch every week to\n"
	.string "watch. Yee-haw!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person21:
	.string "Even out here, I find time to fish\n"
	.string "between battles.$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person22:
	.string "I packed a lunch to watch the battles\n"
	.string "all day!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person23:
	.string "The sun's strong out here. A parasol is\n"
	.string "a must!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person24:
	.string "Can I get you anything? The cafe's\n"
	.string "open while you wait!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person28:
	.string "I've been training for the FRONTIER\n"
	.string "for a year. Almost ready!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person29:
	.string "I came all the way from SNOWPOINT for\n"
	.string "this. It's so warm here!$"

Sinnoh_BattleFrontier_Text_Person30:
	.string "The BATTLE FRONTIER is the place to\n"
	.string "see the toughest TRAINERS. Got a\l"
	.string "story for me?$"

